{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>逆市價!長沙灣牛腩麵店爆紅</p><p>長沙灣小店超抵食$15豬扒包！</p><p>長沙灣街坊小店「森記牛雜粉麵」近日推出超抵食$15豬扒包，不少網民大讚豬扒包份量十足，喺threads爆紅！大大塊炸豬扒即叫即炸，外層金黃香脆，肉質幾juicy，配搭黑椒汁、洋蔥及生菜，做下午茶一流！</p><p>森記牛雜粉麵 地址：長沙灣青山道150號地下C號舖 電話： 2311 2131 營業時間：星期一至日 10:30 – 06:00 官方IG：@sum_kee_noodles_</p><p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179178483430126544_3941659476acc7782abb92.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179178483645242153_8628687726acc778558bec.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179178483979229935_6600633386acc77890df2a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179178484247521340_17782603986acc778adfa4e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17917848442331482_5386409256acc778d4a3c6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T06:18:43.059542+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":376,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}